    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>Chayce uses its own DBS-checked team, holds goods in transit and public liability insurance, and sets out the insurance cover in the service agreement before any move begins. Clients, and the family members helping them, can contact us by phone or email, including to make a complaint.</p></div>
